1	Noun	pickle
1	Noun	chief of staff
1	Noun	floor
1	Noun	desk			# (7)
1	Noun	proposal		# (7)

1	ProperNoun	Sally		# (1)

1	Adj	fine
1	Adj	delicious
1	Adj	perplexed
1	Adj	pickled
1	Adj	lazy			# (8)

1	Prep	with
1	Prep	on
1	Prep	under
1	Prep	in

1	Conj	and			# (2)

1	TransVerb	ate
